{
  "Name": "OpenEMR PHP File Upload Vulnerability",
  "Description": "This module exploits a vulnerability found in OpenEMR 4.1.1 By abusing the ofc_upload_image.php file from the openflashchart library, a malicious user can upload a file to the tmp-upload-images directory without any authentication, which results in arbitrary code execution. The module has been tested successfully on OpenEMR 4.1.1 over Ubuntu 10.04.",
